OL,3,GNEWSAMayor's plan to extend free bus
OL,4,Apass scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FPensioners would be able to travel
OL,7,Fanywhere in East Yorkshire, at any
OL,8,Ftime, using their free bus passes under
OL,9,Fplans proposed by the local mayor.
OL,11,FCurrently, eligible older people can
OL,12,Fuse their concessionary pass any time
OL,13,Fof the day in Hull.
OL,15,FHowever, in the East Riding passes
OL,16,Fcannot be used until 09:30.
OL,18,FLuke Campbell, the mayor of Hull and
OL,19,FEast Yorkshire, said: "I want to make
OL,20,Fsure that every elderly person who has
OL,21,Fthe bus pass in the East Riding has the
OL,22,Fsame opportunities as people in Hull."
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
